{"findings":[{"rule_id":"WPS-004","evidence":[{"kind":"dimension","ref":"D15","page":1,"quote":"⌀ 150 H7"},{"kind":"note","ref":"N3","page":1,"quote":"NOTE : (English) # MATERIAL: M.S. # FINISH: I.Z.B.P. (TRIVALENT) # MACHINING: 3.2 # WEIGHT(Kg ): 175.90 kg"}],"comment":"The ⌀150 H7 bore (D15) is a tight ISO fit on a part that receives zinc plating per note N3, yet the drawing does not state whether the H7 tolerance applies before or after plating. Plating buildup will reduce the bore diameter and can prevent assembly of the mating shaft; the designer must add a note specifying if the H7 limit is pre-plate or post-plate, or adjust the tolerance to allow for coating thickness."
    ,
    "recommended_correction": "Add a note clarifying whether the H7 tolerance on D15 applies before or after plating, or specify an adjusted pre-plate tolerance that accounts for the I.Z.B.P. coating thickness."}]}
